	"Description": "Adds Cotton, as a giftable shohttps://uploaddeimagens.com.br/images/003/145/370/full/cottonsshop.png?1616474601pkeeper:\n<br />\n<br />She is on StardewValley raising funds to comeback for her homeland.\n<br />\n<br />Gift Tastes:\n<br />[spoiler] Loves: Melon,\u00A0Star Shards and Strawberry.\n<br />Likes: Meringue, Rose Milk. [/spoiler]\n<br />\n<br />CottonShop:\n<br />[spoiler]\n<br />Always on stock:\n<br />Cashew Saplings\n<br />Pink Cake\n<br />\n<br />Spring:\n<br />Strawberry Seeds\n<br />Cherry Saplings (for a good price ;) )\n<br />\n<br />Summer:\n<br />Ice Cream\n<br />Cranberry Candy\n<br />\n<br />Fall:\n<br />Plum Pudding\n<br />Poppyseed Muffin\n<br />Blackberry Cobbler\n<br />\n<br />Winter:\n<br />Coffee\n<br />\n<br />Adds cashew tree.\n<br />Adds Rose Cows.\n<br />[/spoiler]\n<br />Heart Events:\n<br />[spoiler]\n<br />2 hearts: In the bustop.\n<br />4 hearts: Beach.\n<br />6 hearts: Cotton's house.\n<br />8 hearts: Railroad.\n<br />[/spoiler]\n<br />\n<br />New Maps:\n<br />Cotton's Stand\n<br />[spoiler]\n<br />\uFEFF[img]https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/424286542643593248/823777743199797248/unknown.png[/img]\n<br />[/spoiler]\n<br />Cotton's House\n<br />[spoiler]\n<br />\uFEFF[img]https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/424286542643593248/823777872937484318/unknown.png[/img]\uFEFF\n<br />[/spoiler]\n<br />???'s house\n<br />[spoiler]\n<br />[img]https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/424286542643593248/823778302522163220/unknown.png[/img]\n<br />[/spoiler]\n<br />SPECIAL THANKS TO:\n<br />- LumiePop for helping me with some sprites.\n<br />- LeafyFetus for his support, coding and more.\n<br />If it weren't for you, it wouldn't be possible &lt;3",
